shorter register_input_batch_warmups(dead_rows=...) API. Remove the last
Triton dispatcher imports, which this port makes unused; keep the original
Triton kernel as a reference. Update the owner-declaration test to the new
API. The TileLang kernel, wrapper semantics and paired benchmark are
unchanged from the qualified standalone candidate.

Base: tilelang-runner-inputs 1bc9f13f620c12ea07b5fd0d8542d1758fb81825.
This integration adjustment passes Ruff and whitespace checks. The kernel
has 32 exactness tests, zero memcheck errors and ten passing performance
cases on candidate 4; the combined runner tree has not been GPU-qualified.
Do not apply this patch as well as the standalone port.
Upstream status: local DS41F experiment, not submitted upstream.
